# Ultimate Lingchi rules: https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/lingchi-warrior (2026-09-22).
# Arena weapons are situational; these values never enhance unrelated equipment.
Incanter Armory Arena	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpellLike	DEFINE:SPHERES_ARENA_RADIUS|0	DEFINE:SPHERES_ARENA_DC|0	DEFINE:SPHERES_ARENA_MINUTES|0	DEFINE:SPHERES_ARENA_DAMAGE_BONUS|0	DEFINE:SPHERES_ARENA_ACTION|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_ARENA_RADIUS|15+5*floor(SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL/2)	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_ARENA_DC|10+floor(SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL/2)+SPHERES_CASTING_ABILITY	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_ARENA_MINUTES|SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_ARENA_DAMAGE_BONUS|SPHERES_CASTING_ABILITY	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_ARENA_ACTION|if(SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL>=20,3,if(SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL>=15,2,if(SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL>=5,1,0)))	DESC:1 SP: %1-ft arena, %2 minutes; 1d6+%3 physical damage, Reflex %4 negates. Exempt yourself and casting-modifier targets. Difficult terrain except yourself; retrieve proficient/craftable melee weapons as masterwork, lasting within arena. Only one arena; standard dismissal. Creation standard/move/swift/free at levels 1/5/15/20; retrieval move/swift/free at 1/5/15.|SPHERES_ARENA_RADIUS|SPHERES_ARENA_MINUTES|SPHERES_ARENA_DAMAGE_BONUS|SPHERES_ARENA_DC
Incanter Enhanced Armory	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DEFINE:SPHERES_ARENA_ENHANCEMENT|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_ARENA_ENHANCEMENT|min(6,floor(SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL/3))	DESC:Arena weapons: +%1, exchangeable for allowed Armorist properties; wielder chooses.|SPHERES_ARENA_ENHANCEMENT
Absolute Control	CATEGORY:Incanter Arsenal Trick	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,12	DESC:You choose arena weapon properties; dismiss individual weapons.
Arena Burst	CATEGORY:Incanter Arsenal Trick	DEFINE:SPHERES_ARENA_BURST_DICE|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_ARENA_BURST_DICE|SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL	DESC:+1 SP: initial damage %1d6 plus casting modifier; Reflex halves.|SPHERES_ARENA_BURST_DICE
Arena Patrol	CATEGORY:Incanter Arsenal Trick	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,6	DESC:Full-round: threaten arena; move within speed for nonprovoking opportunity attacks, swapping weapons. Counts as Guardian patrol.
Bound Armory	CATEGORY:Incanter Arsenal Trick	DEFINE:SPHERES_BOUND_ARMORY_BUDGET|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_BOUND_ARMORY_BUDGET|min(10,floor((SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL+1)/2))	DESC:Your arena weapon budget +%1; enhancement capped at floor(level/3), remainder properties. Counts as bound.|SPHERES_BOUND_ARMORY_BUDGET
Dancing Arena	CATEGORY:Incanter Arsenal Trick	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,14	DESC:Trade four enhancement points: 1d8+casting modifier each turn, Reflex negates; retrieval one step slower.
Friendly Arena	CATEGORY:Incanter Arsenal Trick	DESC:Unlimited exempt targets; they ignore arena terrain.
Material Arena	CATEGORY:Incanter Arsenal Trick	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,6	DESC:Choose cold iron, mithral, silver; adamantine from level 10.
Mobile Arena	CATEGORY:Incanter Arsenal Trick	DEFINE:SPHERES_MOBILE_ARENA_ROUNDS|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_MOBILE_ARENA_ROUNDS|max(1,SPHERES_CASTING_ABILITY)	DESC:Swift: arena follows movement for %1 rounds; ranged concealment 20%%.|SPHERES_MOBILE_ARENA_ROUNDS
Greater Mobile Arena	CATEGORY:Incanter Arsenal Trick	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Arsenal Trick,Mobile Arena	DESC:Moving arena damages traversed squares; ranged/melee concealment 50%%/20%%. Burst requires extra SP each round.
Ultimate Arena	CATEGORY:Incanter Arsenal Trick	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,14	PREABILITY:2,CATEGORY=Incanter Arsenal Trick,Arena Burst,Bound Armory	DEFINE:SPHERES_ULTIMATE_ARENA_DICE|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_ULTIMATE_ARENA_DICE|floor(SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL/2)	DESC:Full-round, 3 SP: burst; +1 SP/turn grants bound budgets and +%1d6 weapon damage; duration %1 rounds. Creator unsafe; no Absolute Control/Mobile Arena.|SPHERES_ULTIMATE_ARENA_DICE